    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {"lesson": "geo910-c2-s1-n43", "text": "问题1。求向量 $\\vec a=(x,y,z)$（图3）的长。"},
      {"lesson": "geo910-c2-s1-n43", "text": "解。利用数性积的坐标公式（§42），得到：\n$\\vec a\\cdot\\vec a=xx+yy+zz$，\n即 $\\vec a^2=x^2+y^2+z^2$，因此，\n$|\\vec a|=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2+z^2}$。"},
      {"lesson": "geo910-c2-s1-n43", "text": "由此可见，向量的长度等于它的坐标的平方和的平方根。"}
    ],
    "inventory": [
      {
        "id": "s03-shared-frame",
        "description": "SOURCE: One unlabelled, unmarked common tail; four solid outward arrows i down-left, j right, k up, a upper-right, with the four overhead-vector labels and no separate dots. MODERN: Hidden labelled tip anchors and literal common [0,0]; displacement values bind screen layout only, not spatial metrics.",
        "objects": ["i-tip", "j-tip", "k-tip", "a-tip", "i-vector", "j-vector", "k-vector", "a-vector"],
        "assertions": ["connect-i", "connect-j", "connect-k", "connect-a", "projection-i-j", "projection-j-k", "projection-k-a", "four-vectors", "no-angle-arcs"],
        "requires": ["pointRelationships"]
      }
    ]
  },
